### BookFlow API - quick manual tests
### Needs the VS Code extension "REST Client" (by Huachao Mao).
### Start the server first: npm run dev
### Then click "Send Request" above any request.

@baseUrl = http://localhost:5000/api

### 1) Health check - is the server running?
GET http://localhost:5000/

### 2) Register a business (salon + owner, in one transaction)
# @name business
POST {{baseUrl}}/auth/register-business
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "businessName": "Test Salon",
  "slug": "test-salon",
  "ownerName": "Ahmad",
  "email": "owner@test.com",
  "password": "secret123"
}

### 3) Login as the owner - the token is saved automatically for the next requests
# @name login
POST {{baseUrl}}/auth/login
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "email": "owner@test.com",
  "password": "secret123"
}

###
@token = {{login.response.body.token}}

### 4) Who am I? (uses the token)
GET {{baseUrl}}/auth/me
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

### 5) Create a service
# @name service
POST {{baseUrl}}/services
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "name": "Haircut",
  "price": 30,
  "duration": 30
}

### 6) List my services
GET {{baseUrl}}/services
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

### 7) Update the service price
PATCH {{baseUrl}}/services/{{service.response.body.service._id}}
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "price": 35
}

### ---------- Try to break it (expect errors!) ----------

### 8) Same slug again -> expect 409
POST {{baseUrl}}/auth/register-business
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "businessName": "Copy Salon",
  "slug": "test-salon",
  "ownerName": "X",
  "email": "someone@test.com",
  "password": "secret123"
}

### 9) Wrong password -> expect 401
POST {{baseUrl}}/auth/login
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "email": "owner@test.com",
  "password": "wrong-password"
}

### 10) No token -> expect 401
GET {{baseUrl}}/services

### ---------- Staff (owner only) ----------

### 12) Owner adds a staff member (try adding "role": "owner" - it will be ignored!)
# @name staff
POST {{baseUrl}}/staff
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "name": "Khaled",
  "email": "khaled@test.com",
  "password": "temp1234",
  "role": "owner"
}

### 13) List my staff
GET {{baseUrl}}/staff
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

### 14) Staff logs in -> then try request 5 (create service) with THIS token -> expect 403
# @name staffLogin
POST {{baseUrl}}/auth/login
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "email": "khaled@test.com",
  "password": "temp1234"
}

### 15) Deactivate the staff member
DELETE {{baseUrl}}/staff/{{staff.response.body.staff.id}}
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

### ---------- Working hours ----------

### 16) My business details + working hours
GET {{baseUrl}}/tenants/me
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

### 17) Update working hours (owner only) - Friday closed, other days 10:00-20:00
PUT {{baseUrl}}/tenants/me/working-hours
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "workingHours": [
    { "day": "saturday",  "isOpen": true,  "open": "10:00", "close": "20:00" },
    { "day": "sunday",    "isOpen": true,  "open": "10:00", "close": "20:00" },
    { "day": "monday",    "isOpen": true,  "open": "10:00", "close": "20:00" },
    { "day": "tuesday",   "isOpen": true,  "open": "10:00", "close": "20:00" },
    { "day": "wednesday", "isOpen": true,  "open": "10:00", "close": "20:00" },
    { "day": "thursday",  "isOpen": true,  "open": "10:00", "close": "16:00" },
    { "day": "friday",    "isOpen": false }
  ]
}

### 18) Break it: closing before opening -> expect 400
PUT {{baseUrl}}/tenants/me/working-hours
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "workingHours": [
    { "day": "saturday",  "isOpen": true, "open": "18:00", "close": "09:00" },
    { "day": "sunday",    "isOpen": true, "open": "10:00", "close": "20:00" },
    { "day": "monday",    "isOpen": true, "open": "10:00", "close": "20:00" },
    { "day": "tuesday",   "isOpen": true, "open": "10:00", "close": "20:00" },
    { "day": "wednesday", "isOpen": true, "open": "10:00", "close": "20:00" },
    { "day": "thursday",  "isOpen": true, "open": "10:00", "close": "20:00" },
    { "day": "friday",    "isOpen": false }
  ]
}

### ---------- Appointments (customer books) ----------
### Run 2, 3 and 5 first (business + owner token + a service).
### The date must be in the FUTURE and not a Friday - change it if needed.

### 19) Owner adds an ACTIVE staff member to book with (Khaled was deactivated in 15)
# @name staff2
POST {{baseUrl}}/staff
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "name": "Omar",
  "email": "omar@test.com",
  "password": "temp1234"
}

### 20) Register a customer
POST {{baseUrl}}/auth/register
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "name": "Sara",
  "email": "sara@test.com",
  "password": "secret123"
}

### 21) Customer logs in
# @name customerLogin
POST {{baseUrl}}/auth/login
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "email": "sara@test.com",
  "password": "secret123"
}

###
@customerToken = {{customerLogin.response.body.token}}

### 22) Book Haircut with Omar on Saturday at 10:00 -> expect 201
POST {{baseUrl}}/appointments
Authorization: Bearer {{customerToken}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "slug": "test-salon",
  "serviceId": "{{service.response.body.service._id}}",
  "staffId": "{{staff2.response.body.staff.id}}",
  "date": "2026-10-03",
  "time": "10:00"
}

### 23) Break it: 10:15 overlaps with 22 -> expect 409
POST {{baseUrl}}/appointments
Authorization: Bearer {{customerToken}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "slug": "test-salon",
  "serviceId": "{{service.response.body.service._id}}",
  "staffId": "{{staff2.response.body.staff.id}}",
  "date": "2026-10-03",
  "time": "10:15"
}

### 24) Starts exactly when 22 ends -> expect 201 (touching is NOT overlapping)
### (the service is 30 min if you skipped request 7)
POST {{baseUrl}}/appointments
Authorization: Bearer {{customerToken}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "slug": "test-salon",
  "serviceId": "{{service.response.body.service._id}}",
  "staffId": "{{staff2.response.body.staff.id}}",
  "date": "2026-10-03",
  "time": "10:30"
}

### 25) Break it: Friday (closed) -> expect 400
POST {{baseUrl}}/appointments
Authorization: Bearer {{customerToken}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "slug": "test-salon",
  "serviceId": "{{service.response.body.service._id}}",
  "staffId": "{{staff2.response.body.staff.id}}",
  "date": "2026-10-02",
  "time": "11:00"
}

### 26) Break it: the OWNER tries to book -> expect 403 (customers only)
POST {{baseUrl}}/appointments
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "slug": "test-salon",
  "serviceId": "{{service.response.body.service._id}}",
  "staffId": "{{staff2.response.body.staff.id}}",
  "date": "2026-10-03",
  "time": "12:00"
}
